One more lesson to share. The price of honor. The power of friendship.
And the way you must fight when only the winner survives.

2
00:08:04,285 --> 00:08:10,285
The Karate Kid Part II is a adventure, drama, action
film directed by John G. Avildsen.

3
00:12:06,428 --> 00:12:12,428
Summoned by his dying father, Miyagi returns to his homeland of
Okinawa, with Daniel, after a 40-year exile.

4
00:16:08,571 --> 00:16:14,571
There he must confront Yukie, the love of his youth, and Sato,
his former best friend turned vengeful rival.

5
00:20:10,714 --> 00:20:16,714
Sato is bent on a fight to the death, even if it
means the destruction of their village.

6
00:24:12,857 --> 00:24:18,857
Daniel finds his own love in Yukia's niece, Kumiko, and his
own enemy in Sato's nephew, the vicious Chozen.

7
00:28:15,000 --> 00:28:21,000
Now, far away from the tournaments, cheering crowds and safety of home, Daniel will
face his greatest challenge ever when the cost of honor is life itself.

8
